        <parameter>
            <valueName>layer:SOREM:1.0:Broadcast_Text</valueName>
            <value>At 6:41 p.m. Central Daylight Time Sunday, Environment Canada has issued a tornado warning for Westman Manitoba. Extra care and attention should be exercised in and around the following localities: Virden and Kenton. Environment Canada meteorologists are tracking a severe thunderstorm that is possibly producing a tornado. Damaging winds and large hail are also possible. Take cover immediately if threatening weather approaches. Please consult local media for more information.</value>
